RF-DETR MLX Lite

Experimental implementation inspired by RF-DETR (Roboflow, Inc.).
Reference: https://github.com/roboflow/rf-detr
Inspected reference commit: eca736acab9f6fe93f2cbc82a1d9f6edfb53f0ea
Upstream RF-DETR is licensed under Apache License 2.0.

The MLX implementation uses a different convolutional backbone and a simplified
single-scale decoder. It is not an official Roboflow release and is not compatible
with upstream pretrained checkpoints. No upstream model weights are included.
